{"seq":2,"slug":"barter-goods-valuation-verification","title":"易货商品估值与等价性核验方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/barter-clearing-settlement/barter-goods-valuation-verification","wordCount":2667,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"易货商品估值与等价性核验方法\">易货商品估值与等价性核验方法</h1><p>一份易货合同里真正的争议点很少是&quot;货到没到&quot;，而是&quot;github 上那两批货到底算不算等价&quot;。A 方交了一船巴西大豆，B 方回了一批二手机床：大豆有逐日波动的期货价，机床只有一台模糊的二手报价。双方在签约时都写了&quot;等值交换&quot;，交割后却发现按当月指数重算，差额接近合同额的 12%。这类纠纷的根因不是诚信问题，而是<strong>估值口径没有在签约阶段被固定成可复算的公式</strong>——&quot;等价&quot;必须从形容词变成一组可核验的数字。</p>\n<p>本文承接同章的 <a href=\"barter-direct-clearing-account\">直接易货与双边清算账户运作机制</a>，那篇讲的是差额记账与净额结算，本篇讲的是<strong>记进账本的那个价从哪来、凭什么说两边等价</strong>。若需要先理解易货在整条对等贸易谱系里的位置，可回看同 hub 的 <a href=\"../countertrade-models-classification/countertrade-types-scenario-fit\">对等贸易类型与适用场景</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-估值基准必须先于等价判断被锁定\">核心概念：估值基准必须先于等价判断被锁定</h2><p>易货估值与普通外贸报价的根本差别在于：普通贸易只有一个价格（卖方的报价），易货有两个方向的价格，且二者之间要建立<strong>比率关系</strong>而不是绝对金额。这个比率一旦失控，海关、税务和外汇三个环节会分别以不同口径找上门——海关关心申报完税价格是否被压低以少缴关税，税务关心关联方之间是否借易货转移利润，外汇管理关心是否存在变相的资金跨境。</p>\n<p>因此工程化的第一步是选定<strong>估值基准（valuation basis）</strong>，并在合同中写明基准的发布机构、品种代码、交割条件和采价窗口。常见基准如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>商品类别</th>\n<th>主流基准来源</th>\n<th>品种/代码粒度</th>\n<th>采价窗口处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有色金属（铜、铝、锌）</td>\n<td>伦敦金属交易所（LME）官方现货结算价</td>\n<td>按品种 + 地区仓库</td>\n<td>常设报价期（QP, Quotation Period）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能源（原油、LNG）</td>\n<td>Platts、Argus 发布的评估价</td>\n<td>按油种/交割地</td>\n<td>提单日前后若干日均价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>农产品（大豆、玉米）</td>\n<td>CBOT/大连商品交易所期货 + 现货升贴水</td>\n<td>按品种 + 蛋白/水分等级</td>\n<td>装运月均价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化工品</td>\n<td>ICIS 评估价</td>\n<td>按规格牌号</td>\n<td>月度结算价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机械设备/二手资产</td>\n<td>第三方评估报告（成本法/市场法/收益法）</td>\n<td>按单台设备</td>\n<td>评估基准日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务/技术</td>\n<td>可比市场交易法、成本加成法</td>\n<td>按里程碑</td>\n<td>合同签署日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键判据：<strong>同一份易货合同里的两条腿必须使用同一时间口径</strong>。如果 A 方的大豆用&quot;装运月均价&quot;，B 方的机床却用&quot;签约日评估值&quot;，那么时间价值差就会被隐性塞进交易里——这正是下一节要靠折现来显性化的部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[确认可交易商品与数量] --&gt; B[选定估值基准&lt;br/&gt;机构/品种/交割条件]&#10;    B --&gt; C[固定采价窗口&lt;br/&gt;QP 或基准日]&#10;    C --&gt; D[做品级与交割条件调整]&#10;    D --&gt; E[按统一折现率做时间价值调整]&#10;    E --&gt; F{对价比 E 是否落在容差带?}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[双方确认记账价&lt;br/&gt;写入清算账户]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H[差额补偿&lt;br/&gt;补货/补汇/调整数量]&#10;    H --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[确认可交易商品与数量] --&gt; B[选定估值基准&lt;br/&gt;机构/品种/交割条件]\n    B --&gt; C[固定采价窗口&lt;br/&gt;QP 或基准日]\n    C --&gt; D[做品级与交割条件调整]\n    D --&gt; E[按统一折现率做时间价值调整]\n    E --&gt; F{对价比 E 是否落在容差带?}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[双方确认记账价&lt;br/&gt;写入清算账户]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H[差额补偿&lt;br/&gt;补货/补汇/调整数量]\n    H --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"海关估价规则如何反过来约束记账价\">海关估价规则如何反过来约束记账价</h2><p>易货双方可以自由协商记账价，但<strong>报关时的完税价格不能自由协商</strong>。世界贸易组织《海关估价协定》（即 GATT 1994 第七条实施协定，WCO 体系下通行）规定了一套有严格适用顺序的六种估价方法，中国对应的成文规则是《中华人民共和国海关审定进出口货物完税价格办法》（海关总署令第 213 号），欧盟与美国分别以 Union Customs Code 与 19 CFR Part 152 实现同一套 WTO 规则。六种方法的适用顺序不可跳级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>顺序</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>易货场景下的可用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>成交价格法（transaction value）</td>\n<td>易货无&quot;实付应付&quot;货币对价，通常不可直接适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>相同货物成交价格法</td>\n<td>有同期同品种可比进口记录时可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>类似货物成交价格法</td>\n<td>规格接近、同产地同产季时可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>倒扣价格法（deductive）</td>\n<td>有境内转售价格时可反推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>计算价格法（computed）</td>\n<td>需境外生产成本数据，举证成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>合理方法（fallback）</td>\n<td>以上均不可用时的兜底，须与协定原则一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践含义很直接：<strong>易货的记账价和报关申报价经常不是同一个数</strong>。记账价服务于双方对价平衡（可以含时间价值与商业折扣），申报价必须落在 WTO 允许的方法序列里，且海关有权在认定申报价&quot;明显偏低&quot;时改用第 2 至第 6 种方法重新核定。若一次易货被海关按第 4 或第 5 种方法重估，补税加滞纳金会直接改变这笔交易的经济性——所以谨慎的做法是在合同中约定&quot;若海关核定价高于记账价，差额部分由哪一方承担&quot;，把这条作为<strong>价格调整条款</strong>写进附件，而不是留到清关时临时扯皮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等价性核验-对价比的构造与容差\">等价性核验：对价比的构造与容差</h2><p>核心的可核验指标是<strong>对价比（equivalence ratio）</strong>。设 A 方交付商品集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，其经调整后的单位价值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；B 方交付商品集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{j\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，单位价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{\\sum_{j} V_j \\, q_j}{\\sum_{i} V_i \\, q_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5615em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理论上完全等价时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。实务中从不要求精确等于 1，而是约定一个<strong>容差带</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1-\\delta,\\ 1+\\delta]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 1%–5%：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，双方越需要频繁补货或补汇，操作成本越高；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，容纳的价格波动越多，但一方承担的不对等风险也越大。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值应与基准价格的日波动率挂钩——用农产品期货做基准时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 3% 以下往往在采价窗口内就会被击穿。</p>\n<p>当基准价格的采价时点不同（例如两条腿相隔 6 个月交货），必须做<strong>时间价值调整</strong>。用统一折现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 把 B 方未来的交付价值折回 A 方的基准日：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_j^{(0)} = \\frac{V_j^{(t)}}{\\left(1 + r\\right)^{t}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4578em;vertical-align:-0.413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9212em;vertical-align:-1.0735em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8478em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2213em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9335em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2748em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8478em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0735em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 应当取自双方共同认可的无风险利率（如对应币种的 SOFR 或 SHIBOR）+ 信用利差，并在合同中写死。忽略这一步的典型后果是：远期交货的一腿被系统性高估，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 长期偏离 1，最终以&quot;账面差额&quot;形式沉淀在清算账户里——这正是 <a href=\"barter-direct-clearing-account\">直接易货与双边清算账户运作机制</a> 中摆动额度被反复触发的常见成因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品级-交割条件与质量调整\">品级、交割条件与质量调整</h2><p>即使基准价选对了，若不做品级与交割条件调整，等价性核验仍然会失真。同一种商品的名义价格与实际可交付价值之间隔着一串调整项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>品级升贴水（premium/discount）</strong>：大豆的蛋白含量每差一个百分点、铜的品位每差一个等级，市场都给出明确的美元升贴水，应直接叠加到基准价上。</li>\n<li><strong>交割条件差异</strong>：FOB 与 CIF 之间的运费与保险费差异必须还原到同一贸易术语。国际贸易术语解释通则（Incoterms 2020，ICC 发布）定义了 11 种术语的费用与风险分界点，两条腿若分别采用 FOB 与 DDP，估值时必须把运费、保险、关税逐项加回或扣除。</li>\n<li><strong>质量扣罚</strong>：水分、杂质、破损率超出约定时按公式扣重（例如&quot;水分每超 0.5% 扣重 1%&quot;），扣重直接影响有效数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>状态差异</strong>：新设备与二手设备不具可比性，必须走第三方评估而非市场报价；自用多年后残值评估通常采用成本法的重置成本减折旧。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这些调整项写成显式公式后，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是同口径的，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 才有比较意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第三方检验与证据链\">第三方检验与证据链</h2><p>等价性核验最终要落到<strong>可举证的证据链</strong>上，因为一旦进入海关质疑或仲裁，双方自制的估值表几乎没有证明力。惯例是由独立第三方检验机构出具报告，常见的国际机构包括 SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、TÜV，以及各国官方检验检疫机构。证据链至少覆盖四层：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数量证据</strong>：装运港的重量证书（weight certificate）或水尺计重报告，与卸货港复测结果对照。</li>\n<li><strong>质量证据</strong>：装运前检验（PSI）与卸货港的化验报告，明确化验方法所依据的标准（如 ISO、ASTM、GB）。</li>\n<li><strong>价值证据</strong>：基准价格的原始出处截图或数据授权记录、采价窗口的逐日数据、升贴水依据。</li>\n<li><strong>时点证据</strong>：提单日、到港日、评估基准日，用于时间价值调整的可追溯性。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个务实的做法是把这四层证据绑定到一个<strong>单一基准日</strong>：所有价格、汇率与折现率都锚定在该日，单据上出现的每个日期都能回溯到同一时间轴。证据链断在哪一层，等价性主张就在哪一层失守。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>&quot;等价&quot;必须被写成可复算的公式，而不是形容词；核心指标是对价比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 与容差带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>估值基准（机构 + 品种 + 交割条件 + 采价窗口）必须在签约阶段锁定，两条腿使用同一时间口径。</li>\n<li>海关估价有法定方法序列（WTO 海关估价协定 / 海关总署令第 213 号），记账价与申报价可以不同，但申报价必须可信，差额责任要预先分配。</li>\n<li>时间价值用统一折现率显性化，忽略它会把隐性差额沉淀进清算账户。</li>\n<li>品级升贴水、Incoterms 交割条件、质量扣罚必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 中同口径调整。</li>\n<li>证据链覆盖数量、质量、价值、时点四层，并由独立第三方检验机构支撑，才具备抗质疑能力。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>WTO《海关估价协定》（Agreement on Implementation of Article VII of GATT 1994）文本与 WCO 技术委员会意见，是估价方法序列的原始出处。</li>\n<li>中国海关总署令第 213 号《审定进出口货物完税价格办法》，是国内落地的直接依据。</li>\n<li>ICC《国际贸易术语解释通则 2020》（Incoterms 2020），用于交割条件还原。</li>\n<li>LME、Platts、Argus、CBOT 等基准发布机构的价格方法论文件，决定采价窗口的合法取数方式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"易货商品估值与等价性核验方法","id":"易货商品估值与等价性核验方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：估值基准必须先于等价判断被锁定","id":"核心概念-估值基准必须先于等价判断被锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"海关估价规则如何反过来约束记账价","id":"海关估价规则如何反过来约束记账价"},{"level":2,"text":"等价性核验：对价比的构造与容差","id":"等价性核验-对价比的构造与容差"},{"level":2,"text":"品级、交割条件与质量调整","id":"品级-交割条件与质量调整"},{"level":2,"text":"第三方检验与证据链","id":"第三方检验与证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"直接易货与双边清算账户运作机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/barter-clearing-settlement/barter-direct-clearing-account"},"next":{"title":"易货结算路径与履约保障安排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/countertrade-barter-offset-operations/barter-clearing-settlement/barter-settlement-performance-security"}}